## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js v18+
- npm
- MongoDB Atlas URI
- Resend API key

### 1. Clone

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Dyno1927/Aroma-Spices.git
cd Aroma-Spices
```

### 2. Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install
# create .env (see Environment Variables below)
npm start
```

Runs on: `http://localhost:5000`

### 3. Seed Database

```bash
npm run seed    # → node scripts/seedProducts.js
```

### 4. Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Runs on: `http://localhost:5173`

