## 📦 Feature Status

### ✅ Phase 1 — Foundation (Complete)

- [x] Express REST API
- [x] Vue 3 + Vue Router (5 routes)
- [x] Ocean & Sand design system (CSS custom properties, dark mode)
- [x] 31 products across 5 categories in MongoDB
- [x] Fuzzy search (Fuse.js)
- [x] Category sidebar filter
- [x] Shopping cart drawer (add / remove / quantity)
- [x] Toast notification system
- [x] Product detail page with image carousel
- [x] Star ratings + review system
- [x] Skeleton loaders with staggered animation
- [x] About & Contact pages
- [x] Deployed live — aromaspicies.com

### ✅ Phase 2 — Auth & Data (Complete)

- [x] JWT authentication (15m access token + 7d httpOnly refresh cookie)
- [x] Signup / login with sliding panel UI (AuthPage.vue)
- [x] Persistent session (refresh on page load)
- [x] Email verification (Resend via HTTPS — SMTP blocked on Render free tier)
- [x] User profile update
- [x] MongoDB Atlas migration (products, users, reviews)
- [x] Contact form email via Resend

### ✅ Phase 3 — Payments (Complete)

- [x] Order model (MongoDB)
- [x] Razorpay util + order controller
- [x] Order routes (create / verify / my orders)
- [x] useRazorpay.js composable
- [x] CheckoutPage.vue (address pre-fill for logged-in users)
- [x] OrderConfirmPage.vue
- [x] Cloudflare Turnstile bot protection

### 📋 Phase 4 — Admin Dashboard (Planned)

- [ ] Admin role + protected routes
- [ ] Product management (CRUD)
- [ ] Order management

### 📋 Phase 5 — Polish (Planned)

- [ ] Multiple images per product
- [ ] Order history in user profile
- [ ] SSR / prerendering for SEO (Nuxt migration evaluation)

