## 🔒 Environment Variables

### `backend/.env`

```
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://...
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your_refresh_secret
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_...
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=...
```

### `frontend/.env`

```
VITE_API_URL=https://aroma-spices.onrender.com
```

---

## 💻 Dev Commands

### Backend

```bash
npm start          # Start server
npm run seed       # Seed 31 products to MongoDB
```

### Frontend

```bash
npm run dev              # Dev server (localhost:5173)
npm run generate-sitemap # Regenerate sitemap.xml from live API
npm run build            # Generate sitemap + Vite build → dist/
npm run preview          # Preview production build
```

### Deploy

```
1. npm run build          → dist/ + sitemap.xml generated
2. Upload dist/ contents  → Hostinger public_html/
3. Upload images/         → public_html/images/
4. Push backend           → GitHub → Render auto-deploys
```

---

## 🎨 Design System — Ocean & Sand

```css
/* Light mode */
--primary: #1e3a5f --accent: #a8c5d6 --bg-page: #f7f6f2 /* Dark mode */
  --primary: #5f8fb3 --bg-page: #0b1420 --bg-card: #1b3952 --text: #f5f1ea
  --accent: #d8c3a5;
```

Dark mode via `.dark` class on `<html>` — toggled by `useTheme.js` (light / system / dark), persisted in localStorage.

---

## 🐛 Known Gotchas

| Issue                                | Fix                                                                    |
| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Render free tier cold start (~30s)   | Ping `/api/products` on app load to pre-warm                           |
| Render blocks SMTP                   | Use Resend HTTPS API for all email                                     |
| Mongoose 7+ async hooks              | Remove `next` param from `async` pre-save hooks entirely               |
| MongoDB defaults to `test` DB        | Pass `{ dbName: 'aroma-spices' }` explicitly in `mongoose.connect()`   |
| Tailwind purges dynamic star classes | Safelist `text-yellow-400` and `text-gray-300` in `tailwind.config.js` |

